(text "Divider 10k/3.3k: 12.6 V -> 3.13 V (LM339 common mode < Vcc - 1.5 V = 3.5 V).\nComparator outputs (open collector) share the Hall pull-ups 4.7k to 3V3:\nclose JP SENSORLESS A/B/C only with the Hall connector unplugged.\n4.7 nF -> fc ~ 17 kHz on each divided phase; firmware adds blanking." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 347.98 490.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45732202-1057-4aa7-8fbb-75d5eceea9c5"))
